# SRG SRG-APP-000830-WSR-000190: The web server must, for password-based authentication, main
# STIG ID: V-264345 (MEDIUM)
# Check: Web server configuration setting

META
    esp_id `web-srg-srg-app-000830-wsr-000190-compromised-password-list-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `web-server`
    criticality `high`

    title `SRG SRG-APP-000830-WSR-000190: The web server must, for password-based authentication, maintain a list of commo`
    description `The web server must, for password-based authentication, maintain a list of commonly used, expected, or compromised passwords on an organization-defined frequency.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `web-server,srg,disa-stig,config,internal`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:SRG-APP-000830-WSR-000190,NIST-800-53:IA-5(1)(A)`
    control_objective `IA-5(1)(A)`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `WebServer:localhost:web-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Review and remediate per DISA Web Server SRG guidance for SRG-APP-000830-WSR-000190.`

    component_id `comp-web-server`

    impl_IA_5_1_A `This control is validated by probing the web server configuration or network endpoint against the DISA Web Server SRG baseline.`

META_END

DEF
    VAR config_path string `/etc/nginx/nginx.conf`

    OBJECT web_config
        path VAR config_path
    OBJECT_END

    STATE config_check
        content string contains `auth`
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN file_content
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF config_check
            OBJECT_REF web_config
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
